            "text": "Our Approach",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_dyBmGT": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_class_name": "richtext-p-section",
            "content": "<p>Our approach to evaluation is thoughtful, comprehensive, and individualized. We do not rely on one test score or one symptom in isolation. Instead, we look carefully at the whole person in context and work to answer the referral question with depth, accuracy, and practical usefulness. The goal is not simply to assign a diagnosis, but to provide insight, clarity, and recommendations that meaningfully guide next steps.</p>"
          }
        },
