        "liquid": "<h4>What This Evaluation Can Clarify</h4>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\">An ADHD evaluation can help determine whether attention-related difficulties are consistent with ADHD or better explained by other factors such as anxiety, trauma, learning differences, mood concerns, or broader executive functioning challenges. For children, the evaluation may help clarify patterns affecting learning, behavior, and school functioning.</p>\n\n<p>For adolescents and adults, it may bring greater understanding to chronic disorganization, mental overload, difficulty sustaining routines, emotional exhaustion, or the longstanding experience of working much harder than others just to keep up.</p>",
