            "title": "AUTISM SPECTRUM",
            "content": "<p>These evaluations help clarify questions related to autism spectrum presentation, including social communication differences, sensory experiences, repetitive patterns, masking, and developmental history. The goal is to provide a thoughtful and comprehensive understanding of the individual’s profile.</p>",
